{"about_the_game":"<strong>&quot;Laundry Simulator&quot; offers an experience in the bustling and challenging world of laundry business. As the owner of a boutique laundry shop, you will handle everything from regular clothes to high-end garments, and you can also sell various laundry-related products. Manage your time and resources wisely, upgrade your equipment, optimize your shop layout, and attract more customers by providing top-quality services.</strong><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customers will bring their dirty laundry for you to sort one piece at a time into laundry baskets, then load into the washing machines. Don't forget, the cleaned clothes need to be dried to ensure quality and customer satisfaction.</h2></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125570/extras/5899c9747daec187aaa49f01372b56fb.poster.avif?t=1763086043\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125570/extras/5899c9747daec187aaa49f01372b56fb.webm?t=1763086043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125570/extras/5899c9747daec187aaa49f01372b56fb.mp4?t=1763086043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Within your laundry shop, not only do you offer washing services, but you can also sell laundry-related products. Carefully select your merchandise, set reasonable prices, and then place them on shelves to attract customers.</h2></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125570/extras/975b9c1456a5f251d023e42f548e0dc7.poster.avif?t=1763086043\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125570/extras/975b9c1456a5f251d023e42f548e0dc7.webm?t=1763086043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125570/extras/975b9c1456a5f251d023e42f548e0dc7.mp4?t=1763086043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast and accurate cashier service is key to increasing customer satisfaction. You need to proficiently scan items and give change. As your business grows, you may even hire a cashier to help manage the increasing flow of customers.</h2></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125570/extras/0ff1135f87ef6c45cf3883854b0088b6.poster.avif?t=1763086043\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125570/extras/0ff1135f87ef6c45cf3883854b0088b6.webm?t=1763086043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125570/extras/0ff1135f87ef6c45cf3883854b0088b6.mp4?t=1763086043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Provide quick and high-quality service to ensure customers are satisfied when they pick up their cleaned clothes. Fast service can maintain customer loyalty and might even earn you extra tips.</h2></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125570/extras/db73759d203fdf0739dbe9a7f4f6d974.poster.avif?t=1763086043\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125570/extras/db73759d203fdf0739dbe9a7f4f6d974.webm?t=1763086043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125570/extras/db73759d203fdf0739dbe9a7f4f6d974.mp4?t=1763086043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keeping your shop clean and tidy is crucial. In addition to regular cleaning, you can also redesign the walls and floors with a paint roller, customizing your own laundry shop style to create an environment that customers want to return to.</h2></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125570/extras/a453a2e3153dc1c4a8846d658dfb9a22.poster.avif?t=1763086043\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125570/extras/a453a2e3153dc1c4a8846d658dfb9a22.webm?t=1763086043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125570/extras/a453a2e3153dc1c4a8846d658dfb9a22.mp4?t=1763086043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >As your business continues to grow, you'll unlock new shop areas, expanding your laundry empire. Optimize your services and facilities to keep customers coming in droves.</h2></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125570/extras/a0ef32ca9faca345bd20f3065f481bf3.poster.avif?t=1763086043\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125570/extras/a0ef32ca9faca345bd20f3065f481bf3.webm?t=1763086043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125570/extras/a0ef32ca9faca345bd20f3065f481bf3.mp4?t=1763086043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >With the growth of your business, you can hire a variety of skilled assistants, including laundry experts, drying technicians, floor cleaners, porters, and stock replenishers, all of whom will be vital to your success.</h2></strong><br>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Load Washed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3125570/876703ae887e4dc5210a1864e4d9789e1ff6c460.jpg"},{"name":"Ten Loads Clean","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3125570/95039a426ab793eaa867ab010f06bc9805255b6c.jpg"},{"name":"Laundry Pro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3125570/7109c3ab137a0774ac1158223c0213d02de1e708.jpg"},{"name":"Heavy Duty Washer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3125570/aa7fd678e11f4372ccfd76aaf46fb09070f84150.jpg"},{"name":"1,000 Orders Done","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3125570/f13f55b4b51f1ceb0219da26832729076c0134a8.jpg"},{"name":"2,000 Orders Later...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3125570/3d92b9ef9a26418ba299b42d9f37cb140b7e711a.jpg"},{"name":"5,000 Loads Later","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3125570/4e96417fd650d18b3d6b799fcbae52ead5585d27.jpg"},{"name":"The Clean Machine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3125570/f35af3fc255c7e4a68b63566bf84d3dde9c41421.jpg"},{"name":"Laundry Tycoon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3125570/40d5485415c2f52b847177efe1d549ce0145acf2.jpg"},{"name":"First Checkout","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3125570/9e2e40b52cff7e10dfdb2145d41da88b429affd7.jpg"}],"total":36},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3125570?t=1763086043","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3125570?t=1763086043","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c